          "actualOutput": "pairwise_distances_chunked (working_memory=1MB): 2 chunk (baris/chunk=[262, 238]) | MaxErr vs Full=0.00e+00\n=== INSPEKSI STRIDES & ZERO-COPY MEMORY LAYOUT ===\n  X_c (Row-Major C) | shape=(500, 128) | strides=(1024, 8)    | C=True  | F=False | view_of_Xc=True\n  X_f (Col-Major F) | shape=(500, 128) | strides=(8, 4000)    | C=False | F=True  | view_of_Xc=False\n  X_c.T (View)      | shape=(128, 500) | strides=(8, 1024)    | C=False | F=True  | view_of_Xc=True\n  X_c[:, 0] (Col)   | shape=(500,)     | strides=(1024,)      | C=False | F=False | view_of_Xc=True\n  X_c[0, :] (Row)   | shape=(128,)     | strides=(8,)         | C=True  | F=True  | view_of_Xc=True",
