          "code": "import numpy as np\n\n# 1. Audit Model Hardware Roofline (Williams-Waterman-Patterson, 2009)\n# Lapisan Linear Y = X @ W dengan d_in = d_out = 2048 dalam FP16 (2 byte)\nd_in, d_out, bpp = 2048, 2048, 2\nprofiles = [\n    (\"CPU Server AVX-512 (FP32 eq)\", 2000.0, 200.0),     # 2 TFLOP/s, 200 GB/s -> I* = 10.0\n    (\"GPU H100 TensorCore (FP16)\", 989_000.0, 3350.0),   # 989 TFLOP/s, 3.35 TB/s -> I* = 295.2\n]\n\nprint(\"=== ANALISIS HARDWARE ROOFLINE (W: 2048x2048, 2 byte/param) ===\")\nfor hw_name, peak_gf, bw_gbs in profiles:\n    ridge = peak_gf / bw_gbs\n    print(f\"Profil: {hw_name} | Peak={peak_gf/1000:.1f} TFLOP/s | BW={bw_gbs:.0f} GB/s | Ridge I*={ridge:.1f} FLOP/B\")\n    for batch in [1, 16, 128, 512, 2048]:\n        flops = 2.0 * batch * d_in * d_out\n        bytes_moved = float(bpp * (batch * d_in + d_in * d_out + batch * d_out))\n        intensity = flops / bytes_moved\n        att_gf = min(peak_gf, intensity * bw_gbs)\n        util_pct = 100.0 * att_gf / peak_gf\n        regime = \"COMPUTE_BOUND\" if intensity >= ridge else \"MEMORY_BOUND\"\n        blas_lvl = \"BLAS-2 GEMV\" if batch == 1 else \"BLAS-3 GEMM\"\n        print(\n            f\"  B={batch:<4d} ({blas_lvl}) | I={intensity:6.1f} FLOP/B | \"\n            f\"Attainable={att_gf/1000:6.2f} TFLOP/s ({util_pct:5.1f}% peak) | {regime}\"\n        )\n\n# 2. Simulator Eksak Cache-Line Fetch (64-byte Cache Line) pada Matriks 1024x1024 FP64\n# Setiap elemen FP64 = 8 byte -> 1 cache line menampung 8 elemen berurutan secara memori\nrows, cols, itemsize, line_bytes = 1024, 1024, 8, 64\nelems_per_line = line_bytes // itemsize\n# Akses baris penuh pada C-Order (stride=8B): tiap 8 elemen cukup 1 fetch cache line\nfetches_row_c = (cols // elems_per_line)\n# Akses kolom penuh pada C-Order (stride=1024*8B=8192B > 64B): tiap 1 elemen memicu 1 cache line baru!\nfetches_col_c = rows\nuseful_bytes = rows * itemsize\nprint(\"=== AUDIT CACHE-LINE LOCALITY (1024x1024 FP64, Cache Line = 64B) ===\")\nprint(f\"Baca 1 Baris (C-Order, stride=8B)    : {fetches_row_c:4d} cache lines ({fetches_row_c*line_bytes/1024:5.1f} KB, efisiensi 100.0%)\")\nprint(f\"Baca 1 Kolom (C-Order, stride=8192B) : {fetches_col_c:4d} cache lines ({fetches_col_c*line_bytes/1024:5.1f} KB, efisiensi {100*useful_bytes/(fetches_col_c*line_bytes):5.1f}%)\")\nprint(f\"Penalti Bandwidth Memori Akses Ortogonal: {fetches_col_c / fetches_row_c:.1f}x lebih banyak lalu lintas cache!\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== ANALISIS HARDWARE ROOFLINE (W: 2048x2048, 2 byte/param) ===\nProfil: CPU Server AVX-512 (FP32 eq) | Peak=2.0 TFLOP/s | BW=200 GB/s | Ridge I*=10.0 FLOP/B\n  B=1    (BLAS-2 GEMV) | I=   1.0 FLOP/B | Attainable=  0.20 TFLOP/s ( 10.0% peak) | MEMORY_BOUND\n  B=16   (BLAS-3 GEMM) | I=  15.8 FLOP/B | Attainable=  2.00 TFLOP/s (100.0% peak) | COMPUTE_BOUND\n  B=128  (BLAS-3 GEMM) | I= 113.8 FLOP/B | Attainable=  2.00 TFLOP/s (100.0% peak) | COMPUTE_BOUND\n  B=512  (BLAS-3 GEMM) | I= 341.3 FLOP/B | Attainable=  2.00 TFLOP/s (100.0% peak) | COMPUTE_BOUND\n  B=2048 (BLAS-3 GEMM) | I= 682.7 FLOP/B | Attainable=  2.00 TFLOP/s (100.0% peak) | COMPUTE_BOUND\nProfil: GPU H100 TensorCore (FP16) | Peak=989.0 TFLOP/s | BW=3350 GB/s | Ridge I*=295.2 FLOP/B\n  B=1    (BLAS-2 GEMV) | I=   1.0 FLOP/B | Attainable=  3.35 TFLOP/s (  0.3% peak) | MEMORY_BOUND\n  B=16   (BLAS-3 GEMM) | I=  15.8 FLOP/B | Attainable= 52.78 TFLOP/s (  5.3% peak) | MEMORY_BOUND\n  B=128  (BLAS-3 GEMM) | I= 113.8 FLOP/B | Attainable=381.16 TFLOP/s ( 38.5% peak) | MEMORY_BOUND\n  B=512  (BLAS-3 GEMM) | I= 341.3 FLOP/B | Attainable=989.00 TFLOP/s (100.0% peak) | COMPUTE_BOUND\n  B=2048 (BLAS-3 GEMM) | I= 682.7 FLOP/B | Attainable=989.00 TFLOP/s (100.0% peak) | COMPUTE_BOUND\n=== AUDIT CACHE-LINE LOCALITY (1024x1024 FP64, Cache Line = 64B) ===\nBaca 1 Baris (C-Order, stride=8B)    :  128 cache lines (  8.0 KB, efisiensi 100.0%)\nBaca 1 Kolom (C-Order, stride=8192B) : 1024 cache lines ( 64.0 KB, efisiensi  12.5%)\nPenalti Bandwidth Memori Akses Ortogonal: 8.0x lebih banyak lalu lintas cache!",
          "actualOutput": "=== ANALISIS HARDWARE ROOFLINE (W: 2048x2048, 2 byte/param) ===\nProfil: CPU Server AVX-512 (FP32 eq) | Peak=2.0 TFLOP/s | BW=200 GB/s | Ridge I*=10.0 FLOP/B\n  B=1    (BLAS-2 GEMV) | I=   1.0 FLOP/B | Attainable=  0.20 TFLOP/s ( 10.0% peak) | MEMORY_BOUND\n  B=16   (BLAS-3 GEMM) | I=  15.8 FLOP/B | Attainable=  2.00 TFLOP/s (100.0% peak) | COMPUTE_BOUND\n  B=128  (BLAS-3 GEMM) | I= 113.8 FLOP/B | Attainable=  2.00 TFLOP/s (100.0% peak) | COMPUTE_BOUND\n  B=512  (BLAS-3 GEMM) | I= 341.3 FLOP/B | Attainable=  2.00 TFLOP/s (100.0% peak) | COMPUTE_BOUND\n  B=2048 (BLAS-3 GEMM) | I= 682.7 FLOP/B | Attainable=  2.00 TFLOP/s (100.0% peak) | COMPUTE_BOUND\nProfil: GPU H100 TensorCore (FP16) | Peak=989.0 TFLOP/s | BW=3350 GB/s | Ridge I*=295.2 FLOP/B\n  B=1    (BLAS-2 GEMV) | I=   1.0 FLOP/B | Attainable=  3.35 TFLOP/s (  0.3% peak) | MEMORY_BOUND\n  B=16   (BLAS-3 GEMM) | I=  15.8 FLOP/B | Attainable= 52.78 TFLOP/s (  5.3% peak) | MEMORY_BOUND\n  B=128  (BLAS-3 GEMM) | I= 113.8 FLOP/B | Attainable=381.16 TFLOP/s ( 38.5% peak) | MEMORY_BOUND\n  B=512  (BLAS-3 GEMM) | I= 341.3 FLOP/B | Attainable=989.00 TFLOP/s (100.0% peak) | COMPUTE_BOUND\n  B=2048 (BLAS-3 GEMM) | I= 682.7 FLOP/B | Attainable=989.00 TFLOP/s (100.0% peak) | COMPUTE_BOUND\n=== AUDIT CACHE-LINE LOCALITY (1024x1024 FP64, Cache Line = 64B) ===\nBaca 1 Baris (C-Order, stride=8B)    :  128 cache lines (  8.0 KB, efisiensi 100.0%)\nBaca 1 Kolom (C-Order, stride=8192B) : 1024 cache lines ( 64.0 KB, efisiensi  12.5%)\nPenalti Bandwidth Memori Akses Ortogonal: 8.0x lebih banyak lalu lintas cache!",
